feat: severity-based email dispatch with admin approval flow

High severity complaints are now auto-dispatched to the department
immediately upon filing — no citizen or admin action needed. Low and
medium severity complaints go to a new pending_approval status where
an admin reviews and clicks Approve & Send to dispatch the email.

- Auto-send: high severity + dept found + confidence OK → email sent
- Pending approval: low/medium severity → admin queue, one-click send
- New endpoint: POST /api/official/complaints/:id/approve
- New status: pending_approval (icon, label, color, CSS, queue filter)
- Citizen review page: shows pending message for low/medium severity
- Citizen send endpoint: routes by severity instead of always sending
- Admin complaint detail: Approve & Send button for pending_approval

